{"severity":"error","file":"errors/session_offer_nonexhaustive_2.march","start_line":20,"start_col":4,"end_line":21,"end_col":45,"message":"`Stream_Prod.offer_more_done` takes one callback for each branch `Cons` can choose in protocol `Stream` (`more` and `done`), but this call leaves out `done`.","code":"session_offer_nonexhaustive","fix":{"kind":"replace","start_line":21,"start_col":44,"end_line":21,"end_col":44,"text":", fn (_v, st) -> Stream_Prod.close(s, st)","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[{"file":"errors/session_offer_nonexhaustive_2.march","start_line":11,"start_col":16,"end_line":11,"end_col":20,"message":"the choice is declared here"}],"notes":["After `done` the conversation ends, so the fix closes it; put any other work for that branch before the `close`."],"category":"PROTOCOL"}
